{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:55:19+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:55:19+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Banca Mediolanum S.p.A.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"Italy","city":"Basiglio","website":"https://www.bancamediolanum.it","employees":4166,"summary":"Banca Mediolanum S.p.A. engages in the provision of various banking products and services in Italy. It offers current accounts; deposits products; and mortgage and personal loans. The company also provides credit cards, debit cards, and prepaid cards; investment products, such as mutual funds, unit linked policies, investment strategies, trading services, asset management services, social security, and bond issues and certificates; and insurance policies, including health and personal, life, serious illness, and autonomy protection, as well as protection assistance, and home and family protection. In addition, it offers SelfyCare Pet for reimbursement of veterinary expenses; SelfyCare Travel for assistance and coverage for risks arising during trips; and SelfyCare LifeProject for a specific life project. Banca Mediolanum S.p.A. founded in 1982 and is headquartered in Basiglio, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Banca Mediolanum S.p.A. s’engage dans la fourniture de divers produits et services bancaires en Italie. Il offre des comptes courants, des produits de dépôts et des prêts hypothécaires et personnels. La société fournit également des cartes de crédit, des cartes de débit et des cartes prépayées; des produits d'investissement, tels que des fonds communs de placement, des politiques liées à des unités, des stratégies d'investissement, des services de négociation, des services de gestion d'actifs, des émissions et des certificats de sécurité sociale et d'obligations; et des polices d'assurance, y compris la protection de la santé et des personnes, la vie, les maladies graves et la protection de l'autonomie."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":16730700800,"shares_outstanding":739315135,"trailing_pe":12.857954,"forward_pe":14.304405,"price_to_book":3.6612196,"ev_to_ebitda":null,"ev_to_revenue":-12.424,"dividend_yield":0.056599997,"payout_ratio":0.7073,"beta_yahoo":0.772},"targets":{"current_price":22.63,"mean":25.50833,"median":25.5,"high":28.0,"low":23.4,"n_analysts":12,"reco_mean":1.91667,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-10"],"eps_avg":0.37272,"eps_low":0.37272,"eps_high":0.37272,"revenue_avg":887000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-20","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.70231,"institutions_pct":0.13121,"institutions_float_pct":0.44074002,"institutions_n":307,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":986,"value":22313,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0042,"shares":3107940,"value":70332679,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0057},{"name":"TR PRICE-Price (T.Rowe) International Growth Equity Trust","pct":0.0034,"shares":2507587,"value":56746691,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.357},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0028,"shares":2112072,"value":47796187,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.020499999},{"name":"T. ROWE PRICE Intl Fd.S, INC.-T. Rowe Price Intl Stock Fd.","pct":0.0026,"shares":1920165,"value":43453332,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0537},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0022,"shares":1628151,"value":36845055,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0123000005},{"name":"Fidelity Rutland Square TRT II-Strategic Advisers Fidelity Intl Fd.","pct":0.0021,"shares":1561650,"value":35340138,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"Fidelity Investment Trust-Fidelity International Small Cap Fund","pct":0.0018000001,"shares":1345700,"value":30453189,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.1294